From 0e2abc407ad0ff3bf668e3592f7e4397b88c3998 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tobias <ruck.tobias@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Apr 2021 12:02:19 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 072/196] Add Taproot key spend path (#130)

This allows Taproot outputs to be spent with a signature for the commitment using BIP341 signatures.

They are still non-standard, but will become standard in a future commit
